{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">2010 AMC 12A #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems\">2010 AMC 10A #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/3/f639dbb01f504247240bdb6c0de30ec2cf579d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{palindrome}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, such as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/6025610adfc4989f16a016dfc9e9d97db9898060.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83438$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, is a number that remains the same when its digits are reversed. The numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> are three-digit and four-digit palindromes, respectively. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b4f56b57667a40fcfe2001bed44b0ac3a9e3cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 22 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 23 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c5caace9b264d66671e4e634194b684cdd7695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1031$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. The minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. However, the only palindrome between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf790a04eb77db1f1eff3f71af761734ef84ebaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1032$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/952151c78199467f06dd77598165b2f8fc012e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$969$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, so the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b3104f61320b27432b8494542a5b28de9b01a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> to be a four-digit number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is in between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808b2fbca1933b6a2d68099725a80ec1caad5d50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$968$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. The palindromes in this range are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/952151c78199467f06dd77598165b2f8fc012e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$969$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de58f4479abeeebc8fb50bd04af83e2c1bf631ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$979$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e7312ef0815158b14fdda0634bc0be2dcf5a3d69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$989$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b3104f61320b27432b8494542a5b28de9b01a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" /> is an option, and upon checking, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d96fab55029c8ffb34af5f15e598f7541f593c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32=1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" /> is indeed a palindrome.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a4f3733907d4c30d269c22a1a6f2d7c4f077ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/610269e2bbcf06111411ad0024b7b316b902c882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 a a 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> and the only palindrome that works is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf3651f08f94af5e6229683abf76d1d706229b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = a$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, that means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13d6f7f6efef4f83b3b195bf6976d7f9f8395bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+32 = 1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/431d131dc79348853523d2967a1d43d51452c771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1001 - 32 = 969$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b3104f61320b27432b8494542a5b28de9b01a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" />.\n~songmath20\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=1444\">https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=1444</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IQj27LEQF4Y\">https://youtu.be/IQj27LEQF4Y</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A\">2010 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink s